---
import PageLayout from "@layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import { buildPageMetadata } from "@lib/metadata/pageMetadata";

const metadata = buildPageMetadata({
  title: "About Bashir Salami — Hands-on Technical Leader",
  description: "A cross-disciplinary software engineer and technical leader working across product, systems, data, cloud, and operations.",
  path: "/about/"
});
---

<PageLayout
  metadata={metadata}
  eyebrow="About"
  title="Hands-on software engineering and technical leadership."
  summary="I design and deliver product interfaces, backend services, data pipelines, cloud infrastructure, and the production practices around them."
>
  <section class="reading-shell mdx-content about-content">
    <p>I am most useful when a user workflow depends on a difficult domain model, a data pipeline changes product behavior, or deployment and observability constraints shape the architecture.</p>
    <p>I stay close to code, infrastructure, data, design decisions, incident investigation, and code review. Technical leadership creates the clarity needed for sound decisions and reliable delivery while keeping implementation feedback close.</p>
    <h2>Working approach</h2>
    <p>Explicit boundaries, typed contracts, accessible interfaces, observable behavior, and explainable trade-offs matter more than adding technology for its own sake.</p>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
